# Local database — has dummy/dev data, diverges per machine.
# Reset/recreate with `rm pos.db && ./goPOS` (seed re-runs).
pos.db

# TLS cert + private key — even self-signed, keys should never be in git.
# Regenerate with the openssl command in decisions/06-https-and-basic-auth.md.
cert.pem
key.pem

# Compiled binary — rebuilt by `go build`.
goPOS


